L["Removed %s unconfirmed herbs and ore."] = "Se quitaron %s hierbas y minerales sin confirmar."
L["Remove %s unconfirmed herbs and ore? These are the ones imported that you haven't gathered yet; the ones you gathered stay. This can't be undone."] = "¿Quitar %s hierbas y minerales sin confirmar? Son los importados que aún no has recolectado; los que recolectaste se quedan. No se puede deshacer."
